      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LADY LLORONA (5) has a strong record this journey with three wins and a minor from five starts. Recorded a nose win (29.86) in a Mix last time at Wentworth Park. Looks a key chance on best form. RAINBOW SHOUT (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (23.36) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Has a good record here including two wins. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Great chance to atone. PITMAN GO QUICK (8) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at The Gardens over 515m behind Mighty Henry (30.53) in a Grade 5. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Key player if finds best. HELLO PRETZEL (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
